# site/ and site-pretty/ are the study's frozen baseline snapshot, committed on main (user decision
# 2026-10-01; pin: baseline.json). They stay Fastwork's property: never push (CLAUDE.md Hard rule 2).
# A re-mirror shows up as a git diff there; .githooks/pre-commit refuses it unless it is an authorized
# snapshot update. Volatile files the tools write into the snapshot dirs stay ignored:
/site/.mirror/missing-local.txt
/site-pretty/.mirror/missing-local.txt
/site/.mirror/chrome-profile/
/site-pretty/.mirror/chrome-profile/
# Per-fix overlays hold full copies of modified Fastwork files: only patch.diff is committed (locally).
fixes/*/overlay/
# measurement output, Chrome profiles, generated certificates
out/
*.pem
node_modules/
.DS_Store
# Claude Code: worktrees created by --worktree / isolation: "worktree" / EnterWorktree, and personal settings
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
